hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20966","Affan narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us from Asim al-Ahwal from Abu Tamimah from the rider behind the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, or from a man from the rider behind the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, that he was upon a donkey which stumbled, and the one behind him said: Wretched Satan. He said: Do not say: Wretched Satan, for if you say: Wretched Satan, he grows and says: By my might I threw you, and if you say: In the name of Allah, he shrinks until he becomes like a fly."
